(1238, 1, 'mail', 'phpmailer', 'queue', 'wp_password_change_notification', '2026-02-23 13:34:58', '[Gestionale QM Festa] Password cambiata', 'Ciao ITINERA PROGETTI E RICERCHE,\n\nquesto messaggio è la conferma che la tua password è stata modificata su Gestionale QM Festa.\n\nSe non hai modificato la tua password, contatta l\'amministratore del sito all\'email\ninfo@qzrstudio.com\n\nQuesta email è stata inviata a segreteria@itinera.info\n\nSaluti,\nil team di Gestionale QM Festa\nhttps://gestionale.qualitymade.eu', '<!doctype html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\">\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\r\n    <title>[Gestionale QM Festa] Password cambiata</title>\r\n    <style>\r\n        @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {\r\n            table[class=body] h1 {\r\n                font-size: 28px !important;\r\n                margin-bottom: 10px !important;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            table[class=body] p,\r\n            table[class=body] ul,\r\n            table[class=body] ol,\r\n            table[class=body] td,\r\n            table[class=body] span,\r\n            table[class=body] a {\r\n                font-size: 16px !important;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            table[class=body] .wrapper {\r\n                padding: 10px !important;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            table[class=body] .content {\r\n                padding: 0 !important;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            table[class=body] .container {\r\n                padding: 0 !important;\r\n                width: 100% !important;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            table[class=body] .main {\r\n                border-left-width: 0 !important;\r\n                border-radius: 0 !important;\r\n                border-right-width: 0 !important;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            img {\r\n                width: 100%;\r\n                height: auto;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</