(713, 1, 'sent', '2026-02-23 14:21:08', '2026-02-23 14:24:15', 'wp_retrieve_password_message', 'info@amitour.net', '', 'Benvenut* nel progetto QM Festa', 'Benvenut* nel progetto QM Festa.\n\nCon il seguente link potrai accedere al gestionale del Progetto e personalizzare la tua password:\n\nhttps://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-login.php?action=rp&key=enhXwBn1c6UxxGHK2URw&login=info%40amitour.net\n\nQuesto link è valido per 24 ore.\n\nPoi, utilizzando la tua email come username e la nuova password creata potrai accedere al tuo spazio privato interno al gestionale da cui aggiornare/modificare i tuoi dati da qui:\n\nhttps://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-admin\n\nLa redazione QM Festa', '<!doctype html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\">\r\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\r\n    <title>Benvenut* nel progetto QM Festa</title>\r\n    <style>\r\n        @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {\r\n            table[class=body] h1 {\r\n                font-size: 28px !important;\r\n                margin-bottom: 10px !important;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            table[class=body] p,\r\n            table[class=body] ul,\r\n            table[class=body] ol,\r\n            table[class=body] td,\r\n            table[class=body] span,\r\n            table[class=body] a {\r\n                font-size: 16px !important;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            table[class=body] .wrapper {\r\n                padding: 10px !important;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            table[class=body] .content {\r\n                padding: 0 !important;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            table[class=body] .container {\r\n                padding: 0 !important;\r\n                width: 100% !important;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            table[class=body] .main {\r\n                border-left-width: 0 !important;\r\n                border-radius: 0 !important;\r\n                border-right-width: 0 !important;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            img {\r\n                width: 100%;\r\n                height: auto;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body class=\"\" style=\"background-color: #EEE; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; padding: 0; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\">\r\n<span class=\"preheader\" style=\"color: transparent; display: none; height: 0; max-height: 0; max-width: 0; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden; mso-hide: all; visibility: hidden; width: 0;\">Benvenut* nel progetto QM Festa.\n\nCon il seguente link potrai acc...</span>\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"body\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; background-color: #EEE; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\" bgcolor=\"#eeeeee\">\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: top;\" valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n        <td class=\"container\" style=\"font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: top; display: block; max-width: 580px; padding: 10px; width: 580px; margin: 0 auto;\" width=\"580\" valign=\"top\">\r\n            <div class=\"content\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 580px; padding: 10px;\">\r\n\r\n                <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"main\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; background: #FFF; border-radius: 5px; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td class=\"wrapper\" style=\"font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 20px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n                            <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n                                <tr>\r\n                                    <td style=\"font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: top;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n                                        Benvenut* nel progetto QM Festa.<br />\n<br />\nCon il seguente link potrai accedere al gestionale del Progetto e personalizzare la tua password:<br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-login.php?action=rp&#038;key=enhXwBn1c6UxxGHK2URw&#038;login=info%40amitour.net\">https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-login.php?action=rp&#038;key=enhXwBn1c6UxxGHK2URw&#038;login=info%40amitour.net</a><br />\n<br />\nQuesto link è valido per 24 ore.<br />\n<br />\nPoi, utilizzando la tua email come username e la nuova password creata potrai accedere al tuo spazio privato interno al gestionale da cui aggiornare/modificare i tuoi dati da qui:<br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-admin\">https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-admin</a><br />\n<br />\nLa redazione QM Festa\r\n                                    </td>\r\n                                </tr>\r\n                            </table>\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"footer\" style=\"clear: both; margin-top: 10px; text-align: center; width: 100%;\">\r\n                    <table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td class=\"content-block\" style=\"font-family: sans-serif; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-top: 10px; color: #999; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\">\r\n                                \r\n                            </td>\r\n                        </tr>\r\n                        <tr>\r\n                            <td class=\"content-block powered-by\" style=\"font-family: sans-serif; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-top: 10px; color: #999; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\">\r\n                                <a href=\"https://plugins.dev4press.com/gd-mail-queue/\">GD Mail Queue plugin for WordPress by Dev4Press</a>\r\n                            </td>\r\n                        </tr>\r\n                    </table>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </td>\r\n        <td style=\"font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 15px; vertical-align: top;\" valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n', '[]', '[]', '{\"CharSet\":\"UTF-8\",\"ContentType\":\"text\\/html\",\"Encoding\":\"8bit\",\"From\":\"qmfesta@tages.it\",\"FromName\":\"QM Festa\"}', '');
