(3532, 381, '2026-02-24 09:56:37', '2026-02-24 08:56:37', '<!-- wp:qzrstudio/object-info {\"fields\":{\"type\":{\"label\":\"POI\",\"value\":\"poi\"},\"name\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Pratovecchio Stia dal Museo della Lana a Romena\"}}},\"position\":{\"address\":\"Pratovecchio Stia AR, Italia\",\"latitude\":43.7985605,\"longitude\":11.7092446,\"data\":{\"address_components\":[{\"long_name\":\"Pratovecchio Stia\",\"short_name\":\"Pratovecchio Stia\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_3\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Provincia di Arezzo\",\"short_name\":\"AR\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_2\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Toscana\",\"short_name\":\"Toscana\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_1\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Italia\",\"short_name\":\"IT\",\"types\":[\"country\",\"political\"]}],\"formatted_address\":\"Pratovecchio Stia AR, Italia\",\"geometry\":{\"bounds\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":43.8779928,\"lng\":11.8073022},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":43.7585736,\"lng\":11.6022218}},\"location\":{\"lat\":43.7985605,\"lng\":11.7092446},\"location_type\":\"APPROXIMATE\",\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":43.8779928,\"lng\":11.8073022},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":43.7585736,\"lng\":11.6022218}}},\"place_id\":\"ChIJE75mZq0KKxMRgKTl45AsCAQ\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_3\",\"political\"]},\"formatted_address\":\"Pratovecchio Stia AR, Italia\"},\"contacts\":{\"email\":\"info@connettersi.net\"},\"description\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Benvenuti nel cuore pulsante del Casentino! \\u003cstrong\\u003ePratovecchio Stia\\u003c/strong\\u003e non è solo un comune sparso tra i boschi dell\'Appennino toscano, ma un viaggio sensoriale tra storia medievale, sapienza artigiana e atmosfere che sembrano essersi fermate nel tempo. Ecco i gioielli che rendono questo borgo una tappa imperdibile:\\u003cbr\\u003e L’Anima Medievale: Romena\\u003cbr\\u003eA pochi minuti dal centro, sorge uno dei complessi più iconici della Toscana:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eIl Castello di Romena:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Un’imponente fortificazione che domina la valle. Fu rifugio per \\u003cstrong\\u003eDante Alighieri\\u003c/strong\\u003e durante il suo esilio e conserva ancora quel fascino epico che ispirò i versi del \\u003cem\\u003eCanto XXX\\u003c/em\\u003e dell\'Inferno. \\u003cstrong\\u003eLa Pieve di San Pietro:\\u003c/strong\\u003e A breve distanza dal castello, questa chiesa romanica è un capolavoro di pietra e luce. I suoi capitelli scolpiti sono tra i più preziosi d’Italia: un luogo di silenzio che tocca l\'anima.\\u003cbr\\u003e L’Arte del Panno Casentino: Il Museo della Lana. Situato nell\'antico Lanificio di Stia, questo museo non è una semplice esposizione, ma un’esperienza tattile. Qui potrete scoprire i segreti del \\u003cstrong\\u003ePanno Casentino\\u003c/strong\\u003e, il celebre tessuto \\u0022riccioluto\\u0022 color arancio becco d’oca o verde bandiera, amato da poeti e nobili. È il racconto di un\'intera comunità che ha costruito la propria identità sulla lana.\\u003cbr\\u003eIl Palagio e il Ferro Battuto \\u003cstrong\\u003ePalagio Fiorentino:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Un elegante palazzo circondato da un parco secolare, oggi sede di prestigiose esposizioni d’arte contemporanea.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eL’Arte del Fuoco:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Stia è la capitale mondiale del ferro battuto. Passeggiando per le piazze, si respira l\'odore del carbone e si sente il ritmo del maglio. Questa tradizione vive tutto l\'anno nelle botteghe artigiane locali.\\u003cbr\\u003e Eventi da non perdere\\u003cbr\\u003eSe volete vivere la vera energia del borgo, segnate queste date:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBiennale Europea d\'Arte Fabbrile:\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Settembre, anni dispari) I migliori fabbri del mondo si sfidano in piazza in una gara di forgiatura dal vivo. Un evento magnetico e ancestrale.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eNaturalmente Pianoforte:\\u003c/strong\\u003e (Luglio) Un festival diffuso dove la musica dei grandi pianisti risuona tra le pievi, i castelli e le piazze, fondendosi con la natura del Parco Nazionale delle Foreste Casentinesi.\\u003cbr\\u003e\"},\"en\":{\"text\":\"Welcome to the beating heart of Casentino! \\u003cstrong\\u003ePratovecchio Stia\\u003c/strong\\u003e is more than just a town scattered among the woods of the Tuscan Apennines; it is a sensory journey through medieval history, artisanal wisdom, and an atmosphere where time seems to have stood still.\\u003cbr\\u003eHere are the gems that make this village an unmissable stop:\\u003cbr\\u003eThe Medieval Soul: Romena\\u003cbr\\u003eJust minutes from the center lies one of Tuscany’s most iconic complexes:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRomena Castle:\\u003c/strong\\u003e An imposing fortress overlooking the valley. It served as a refuge for \\u003cstrong\\u003eDante Alighieri\\u003c/strong\\u003e during his exile and still preserves that epic charm that inspired the verses of \\u003cem\\u003eCanto XXX\\u003c/em\\u003e of the Inferno.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eThe Pieve di San Pietro:\\u003c/strong\\u003e A short distance from the castle, this Romanesque parish church is a masterpiece of stone and light. Its sculpted capitals are among the most precious in Italy—a place of silence that touches the soul.\\u003cbr\\u003e The Art of Casentino Cloth: The Wool Museum\\u003cbr\\u003eHoused in the ancient Wool Mill of Stia, this museum is not just an exhibition, but a tactile experience. Here, you can discover the secrets of \\u003cstrong\\u003ePanno Casentino\\u003c/strong\\u003e, the famous \\u0022curled\\u0022 fabric in iconic colors like \\u0022goose-beak\\u0022 orange or flag green, beloved by poets and nobles alike. It tells the story of an entire community that built its identity on wool.\\u003cbr\\u003e Palagio and Wrought Iron\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003ePalagio Fiorentino:\\u003c/strong\\u003e An elegant palace surrounded by a centuries-old park, now home to prestigious contemporary art exhibitions.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eThe Art of Fire:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Stia is the world capital of wrought iron. Walking through the squares, you can smell the charcoal and hear the rhythmic beat of the power hammer. This tradition lives year-round in the local artisan workshops.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📅 Events Not to Miss\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you want to experience the true energy of the village, mark these dates:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eEuropean Biennial of Blacksmith Art:\\u003c/strong\\u003e (September, odd years) The world’s best blacksmiths compete in the square during a live forging competition. A magnetic and ancestral event.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eNaturalmente Pianoforte:\\u003c/strong\\u003e (July) A widespread festival where the music of great pianists echoes through parish churches, castles, and squares, blending perfectly with the nature of the Foreste Casentinesi National Park.\"}}}}} /-->', 'Pratovecchio Stia  dal  Museo della Lana a Romena', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3438-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-02-24 09:56:37', '2026-02-24 08:56:37', '', 3438, 'https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/?p=3532', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3534, 382, '2026-02-24 18:59:00', '2026-02-24 17:59:00', '<!-- wp:qzrstudio/object-info {\"fields\":{\"name\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Festa di San Michele Arcangelo\"},\"fr\":{\"text\":\"Fête de Saint-Michel Archange\"}}},\"description\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Il borgo medievale di Pigna celebra il suo patrono con una processione molto sentita, unita a musica, balli e un pranzo comunitario in cui assaggiare cibi tipici. La festa unisce tradizione e convivialità, coinvolgendo residenti e visitatori.\"},\"fr\":{\"text\":\"Le village médiéval de Pigna célèbre son saint patron par une procession très suivie, accompagnée de musique, danses et d’un repas communautaire avec dégustation de spécialités locales. La fête allie tradition et convivialité pour habitants et visiteurs.\"}}},\"type\":{\"label\":\"Sagra\",\"value\":\"festival\"},\"additional_info\":{\"date_text\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"29 settembre\"},\"fr\":{\"text\":\"29 septembre\"},\"en\":{\"text\":\"29th September\"}}},\"dates\":[{\"date_start\":{\"formatted\":\"2026-09-29\",\"timestamp\":1790640000},\"date_end\":{\"formatted\":\"2026-09-29\",\"timestamp\":1790640000},\"unique_id\":\"MTc2ODMxODg5MTA2MV9zcWQwNGlvczU4XzAuMDkxMTcyNzQzMjE2OTMwNDc=\"}],\"accessibility\":{\"label\":\"Alta\",\"value\":\"3\"}},\"position\":{\"address\":\"Pigna (IM)\",\"latitude\":43.932987565,\"longitude\":7.663568447,\"data\":{\"address_components\":[{\"long_name\":\"\",\"short_name\":\"\",\"types\":[\"street_number\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Pigna (IM)\",\"short_name\":\"Pigna (IM)\",\"types\":[\"route\"]},{\"long_name\":\"\",\"short_name\":\"\",\"types\":[\"locality\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"\",\"short_name\":\"\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_3\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"\",\"short_name\":\"\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_2\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"\",\"short_name\":\"\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_1\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"\",\"short_name\":\"\",\"types\":[\"country\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"\",\"short_name\":\"\",\"types\":[\"postal_code\"]}],\"formatted_address\":\"Pigna (IM)\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":43.932987565,\"lng\":7.663568447},\"location_type\":\"\",\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":43.932987565,\"lng\":7.663568447},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":43.932987565,\"lng\":7.663568447}}},\"navigation_points\":[{\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.932987565,\"longitude\":7.663568447}}],\"place_id\":\"\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"\",\"global_code\":\"\"},\"types\":[]},\"formatted_address\":\"Pigna (IM)\"},\"gallery\":[{\"id\":1396,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/San-Michele-Arcangelo-Pigna-1-scaled.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":1398,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/San-Michele-Arcangelo-Pigna-3-scaled.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":1404,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/San-Michele-Arcangelo-Pigna-5-scaled.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":1397,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/San-Michele-Arcangelo-Pigna-2-scaled.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"}],\"contacts\":{\"website\":\"www.comune.pigna.im.it\",\"email\":\"iatpigna@gmail.com\",\"telephone\":\"0039 0184 241016\",\"instagram\":\"asd_pignese\"},\"video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2f7eO4V_DWM\"}} /-->', 'Festa di San Michele Arcangelo', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '827-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-02-24 18:59:00', '2026-02-24 17:59:00', '', 827, 'https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/?p=3534', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
