(3611, 1, '2026-02-26 11:03:44', '2026-02-26 10:03:44', '<!-- wp:qzrstudio/object-info {\"fields\":{\"type\":{\"label\":\"POI\",\"value\":\"poi\"},\"name\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Borgo di Moggiona ed ecomuseo\"},\"fr\":{\"text\":\"Ecomuseo\"}}},\"position\":{\"address\":\"Moggiona AR, Italia\",\"latitude\":43.7834467,\"longitude\":11.7918909,\"data\":{\"address_components\":[{\"long_name\":\"Moggiona\",\"short_name\":\"Moggiona\",\"types\":[\"locality\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Poppi\",\"short_name\":\"Poppi\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_3\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Provincia di Arezzo\",\"short_name\":\"AR\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_2\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Toscana\",\"short_name\":\"Toscana\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_1\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Italia\",\"short_name\":\"IT\",\"types\":[\"country\",\"political\"]}],\"formatted_address\":\"Moggiona AR, Italia\",\"geometry\":{\"bounds\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":43.7835609,\"lng\":11.796214},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":43.7804447,\"lng\":11.7894246}},\"location\":{\"lat\":43.7834467,\"lng\":11.7918909},\"location_type\":\"APPROXIMATE\",\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":43.7835609,\"lng\":11.796214},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":43.7804447,\"lng\":11.7894246}}},\"partial_match\":true,\"place_id\":\"ChIJg0WnkQaeKxMR3oI_vzPmKDE\",\"types\":[\"locality\",\"political\"]},\"formatted_address\":\"Moggiona AR, Italia\"},\"description\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Moggiona: Il Borgo del Legno e  del Lupo\\u003cbr\\u003eNel cuore più profondo del \\u003cstrong\\u003eParco Nazionale delle Foreste Casentinesi\\u003c/strong\\u003e, esiste un borgo che sembra scolpito direttamente nei tronchi d\'abete: \\u003cstrong\\u003eMoggiona\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Qui, la storia non si legge sui libri, ma si ascolta nel picchiettare degli scalpelli e nel silenzio magico dei boschi che lo stringono in un abbraccio secolare. L’Anima di Legno: L’Ecomuseo del Bigonaio\\u003cbr\\u003eMoggiona è, da sempre, il paese dei \\u003cstrong\\u003eBigonai\\u003c/strong\\u003e. Per secoli, gli abitanti hanno trasformato il legno della foresta in \\u003cem\\u003ebigoni\\u003c/em\\u003e (i contenitori per l\'uva), rendendo questo borgo famoso in tutta la Toscana.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eL\'Ecomuseo:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Non è solo una mostra, è un viaggio nel tempo. Entrando, si respira l’odore della resina e della fatica nobile. Potrete vedere gli antichi attrezzi e capire come una comunità intera sia riuscita a vivere in simbiosi perfetta con l\'albero, trasformando la necessità in arte. \\u003cstrong\\u003eLa Comunità:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Questa eredità artigiana vive ancora oggi nelle botteghe e negli occhi dei residenti, custodi orgogliosi di un sapere che non vuole morire.\\u003cbr\\u003eSulle Tracce del Predatore: Il Percorso del Lupo\\u003cbr\\u003eMa Moggiona non è solo artigianato; è la porta d’accesso al lato più selvaggio della natura.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eIl Sentiero Didattico:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Il celebre \\u003cstrong\\u003ePercorso del Lupo\\u003c/strong\\u003e è un itinerario unico che si snoda intorno al borgo. È un\'esperienza immersiva, pensata per grandi e piccoli, che racconta la vita, i miti e la realtà del predatore più iconico dell\'Appennino.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eL\'Emozione:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Camminare tra i faggi sapendo che, da qualche parte tra le ombre, il lupo osserva invisibile, regala un brivido di autentica connessione con l\'ambiente selvaggio.\\u003cbr\\u003eEventi e Tradizioni: Il Sapore della Storia\\u003cbr\\u003eIl borgo si accende durante gli eventi estivi e autunnali, quando le piazze si riempiono di artigiani e profumi di cucina tipica.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLa Mostra dell\'Artigianato:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Ogni anno, Moggiona celebra le sue radici con manifestazioni che mettono in mostra il lavoro del legno, tra canti popolari e tavolate imbandite.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eGastronomia:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Non lasciate il borgo senza aver assaggiato i piatti della tradizione casentinese, dove i frutti del sottobosco sono i veri protagonisti.\"}}},\"video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0-xPX3QimHY\",\"subtype\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Borgo-Natura-Cultura-Enogatronomia\"}}},\"gallery\":[{\"id\":3604,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/maggiona-parco.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3605,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/moggiona-borgo.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3606,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/moggiona-copertina-1.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3607,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/moggiona-natale.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3608,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/moggiona-neve.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"}],\"contacts\":{\"email\":\"info@moggiona.it\",\"facebook\":\"https://www.facebook.com/ProLocoMoggiona\"},\"additional_info\":{\"accessibility\":{\"label\":\"Media\",\"value\":\"2\"}}}} /-->', 'Borgo di Moggiona- L\'Ecomuseo ed il percorso del lupo', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '3449-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-02-26 11:03:44', '2026-02-26 10:03:44', '', 3449, 'https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/?p=3611', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(3612, 391, '2026-02-26 14:44:45', '2026-02-26 13:44:45', '<!-- wp:qzrstudio/object-info {\"fields\":{\"type\":{\"label\":\"POI\",\"value\":\"poi\"},\"name\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Museo Archeologico Comunale\"},\"fr\":{\"text\":\"Musée Archéologique Municipal\"},\"en\":{\"text\":\"Municipal Archaeological Museum\"}}},\"subtype\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Museo\"},\"fr\":{\"text\":\"Musée\"},\"en\":{\"text\":\"Museum\"}}},\"position\":{\"address\":\"Via Francesco Domenico Guerrazzi, 7, 57023 Cecina LI, Italia\",\"latitude\":43.318489,\"longitude\":10.498637,\"data\":{\"address_components\":[{\"long_name\":\"7\",\"short_name\":\"7\",\"types\":[\"street_number\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Via Francesco Domenico Guerrazzi\",\"short_name\":\"Via Francesco Domenico Guerrazzi\",\"types\":[\"route\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Cecina\",\"short_name\":\"Cecina\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_3\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Provincia di Livorno\",\"short_name\":\"LI\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_2\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Toscana\",\"short_name\":\"Toscana\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_1\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Italia\",\"short_name\":\"IT\",\"types\":[\"country\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"57023\",\"short_name\":\"57023\",\"types\":[\"postal_code\"]}],\"formatted_address\":\"Via Francesco Domenico Guerrazzi, 7, 57023 Cecina LI, Italia\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":43.3189554,\"lng\":10.4983317},\"location_type\":\"ROOFTOP\",\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":43.3203043802915,\"lng\":10.4996806802915},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":43.3176064197085,\"lng\":10.4969827197085}}},\"navigation_points\":[{\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.3189753,\"longitude\":10.4983078}}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJ7Qj9TJD91RIRPV3uHHbvdWQ\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"8F9X+H8 Cecina LI, Italia\",\"global_code\":\"8FMG8F9X+H8\"},\"types\":[\"street_address\"]},\"formatted_address\":\"Via Francesco Domenico Guerrazzi, 7, 57023 Cecina LI, Italia\"},\"additional_info\":{\"accessibility\":{\"label\":\"Media\",\"value\":\"2\"},\"date_text\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Dal 1 Maggio al 30 Settembre:  - Mercoledì e Giovedì: 17:00-20:00;     - Venerdì, Sabato e Domenica: 10:00-13:00 / 17:00-20:00            Dal 1 Ottobre al 30 Aprile:  - Mercoledì e Giovedì: 14:00-17:00;     - Venerdì, Sabato e Domenica:  10:00-13:00 / 14:00-17:00                                                                                                                  𝐁𝐈𝐆𝐋𝐈𝐄𝐓𝐓𝐈 𝐌𝐔𝐒𝐄𝐎: • Intero 4,50€ • Ridotto (6-18 anni, over 65, Studente della Toscana) 3,00€ • Cumulativo (MUSEO+PARCO) 6,00€ • Famiglia (2 adulti + 2 minori paganti) 10,00€ • Cumulativo Famiglia 15,00€ • Gratuito (0-5 anni, persone con disabilità + accompagnatore, membri ICOM) 0,00€                   \"},\"fr\":{\"text\":\"Du 1er Mai au 30 Septembre : - Mercredi et Jeudi: 17:00-20:00;     - Vendredi, Samedi et Dimanche: 10:00-13:00 / 17:00-20:00            Du 1er Octobre au 30 Avril :  - Mercredi et Jeudi: 14:00-17:00;     - Vendredi, Samedi et Dimanche: 10:00-13:00 / 14:00-17:00                                                                                 BILLETS MUSÉE : • Plein tarif 4,50€ • Tarif réduit (6-18 ans, plus de 65 ans, étudiants de Toscane) 3,00€ • Cumulatif (MUSÉE+PARC) 6,00€ • Famille (2 adultes + 2 enfants payants) 10,00€ • Cumulatif famille 15,00€ • Gratuit (0-5 ans, personnes handicapées + accompagnateur, membres ICOM) 0,00€\"},\"en\":{\"text\":\"From 1 May to 30 September: - Wednesday and Thursday: 5:00 pm to 8:00 pm;      - Friday, Saturday and Sunday: 10:00 am to 1:00 pm / 5:00 pm to 8:00 pm            From 1 October to 30 April:  - Wednesday and Thursday: 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m.;      - Friday, Saturday and Sunday: 10:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m. / 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m.                                                                                                                                       MUSEUM TICKETS: • Full price €4.50 • Reduced price (6-18 years old, over 65, students from Tuscany) €3.00 • Combined ticket (MUSEUM+PARK) €6.00 • Family (2 adults + 2 paying children) €10.00 • Combined family ticket €15.00 • Free (0-5 years old, people with disabilities + accompanying person, ICOM members) €0.00\"}}}},\"contacts\":{\"telephone\":\"0586 61 15 88\",\"email\":\"museoarcheologico@comune.cecina.li.it\",\"website\":\"https://www.comune.cecina.livorno.it/area_letturaLuogo/1135/pagsistema.html \",\"facebook\":\"https://www.facebook.com/MuseoeParcoArcheologicodiCecina\",\"instagram\":\"https://www.instagram.com/museo_parco_archeologicocecina/\"},\"gallery\":[{\"id\":3624,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/IMG_5011-Migliorato-NR-scaled.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3628,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/creta.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3625,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/IMG_5029-Migliorato-NR-scaled.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3627,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/tholos.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3626,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/IMG_5013-Migliorato-NR-scaled.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"}],\"description\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Il Museo Archeologico Comunale di Cecina racconta la storia archeologica della Bassa Val di Cecina, una delle aree di maggiore bellezza dell\'intera Toscana. In questa valle le civiltà etrusca e romana hanno lasciato alcune delle loro maggiori testimonianze. \\u003cbr\\u003eAttraverso un suggestivo percorso, i visitatori e le visitatrici vengono accompagnati in un affascinante viaggio nel passato, dall\'Età Preistorica all\'Età Romana.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://museoparcoarcheologicocecina.visitcecina.com/guida-del-museo/\\u0022 data-type=\\u0022link\\u0022 data-id=\\u0022https://museoparcoarcheologicocecina.visitcecina.com/guida-del-museo/\\u0022\\u003eClicca e guarda in anteprima la guida digitale del Museo!\\u003c/a\\u003e\"},\"en\":{\"text\":\"The Municipal Archaeological Museum of Cecina recounts the archaeological history of the Lower Val di Cecina, one of the most beautiful areas in all of Tuscany. The Etruscan and Roman civilisations left some of their most important artefacts in this valley.\\u003cbr\\u003eVisitors are taken on a fascinating journey through time, from prehistoric times to the Roman era, along an evocative itinerary.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://museoparcoarcheologicocecina.visitcecina.com/guida-del-museo/\\u0022\\u003e\\u003ckbd\\u003eClick and preview the Museum\'s digital guide!\\u003c/kbd\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\"},\"fr\":{\"text\":\"Le Musée Archéologique Municipal de Cecina retrace l\'histoire archéologique de la Basse Vallée de Cecina, l\'une des plus belles régions de toute la Toscane. C\'est dans cette vallée que les civilisations étrusque et romaine ont laissé certaines de leurs plus belles traces.\\u003cbr\\u003eAu fil d\'un parcours évocateur, les visiteurs sont accompagnés dans un fascinant voyage à travers le temps, de la préhistoire à l\'époque romaine.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://museoparcoarcheologicocecina.visitcecina.com/guida-del-museo/\\u0022\\u003e\\u003ckbd\\u003eCliquez ici pour consulter le guide digital du Musée!\\u003c/kbd\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\"}}},\"video\":\"\"}} /-->', 'Museo Archeologico Comunale', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'museo-archeologico-comunale', '', '', '2026-03-04 14:47:36', '2026-03-04 13:47:36', '', 0, 'https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/?post_type=qzr_object&#038;p=3612', 0, 'qzr_object', '', 0),
(3613, 391, '2026-02-26 14:47:05', '2026-02-26 13:47:05', '<!-- wp:qzrstudio/object-info {\"fields\":{\"type\":{\"label\":\"POI\",\"value\":\"poi\"},\"name\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Parco Archeologico Comunale\"},\"fr\":{\"text\":\"Parc Archéologique Municipal\"},\"en\":{\"text\":\"Municipal Archaeological Park\"}}},\"subtype\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Parco\"},\"fr\":{\"text\":\"Parc\"},\"en\":{\"text\":\"Park\"}}},\"position\":{\"address\":\"Via C. Ginori, 33, 57023 Cecina LI, Italia\",\"latitude\":43.3098628,\"longitude\":10.5104652,\"data\":{\"address_components\":[{\"long_name\":\"33\",\"short_name\":\"33\",\"types\":[\"street_number\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Via C. Ginori\",\"short_name\":\"Via C. Ginori\",\"types\":[\"route\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Cecina\",\"short_name\":\"Cecina\",\"types\":[\"locality\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Cecina\",\"short_name\":\"Cecina\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_3\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Provincia di Livorno\",\"short_name\":\"LI\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_2\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Toscana\",\"short_name\":\"Toscana\",\"types\":[\"administrative_area_level_1\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"Italia\",\"short_name\":\"IT\",\"types\":[\"country\",\"political\"]},{\"long_name\":\"57023\",\"short_name\":\"57023\",\"types\":[\"postal_code\"]}],\"formatted_address\":\"Via C. Ginori, 33, 57023 Cecina LI, Italia\",\"geometry\":{\"location\":{\"lat\":43.3098628,\"lng\":10.5104652},\"location_type\":\"ROOFTOP\",\"viewport\":{\"northeast\":{\"lat\":43.3113279302915,\"lng\":10.5117112802915},\"southwest\":{\"lat\":43.3086299697085,\"lng\":10.5090133197085}}},\"navigation_points\":[{\"location\":{\"latitude\":43.3100422,\"longitude\":10.5103063}}],\"place_id\":\"ChIJS_A6WfT91RIRqKcExdMaU_Q\",\"plus_code\":{\"compound_code\":\"8G56+W5 Cecina LI, Italia\",\"global_code\":\"8FMG8G56+W5\"},\"types\":[\"street_address\"]},\"formatted_address\":\"Via C. Ginori, 33, 57023 Cecina LI, Italia\"},\"description\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Il Parco Archeologico Comunale sorge su una piccola altura in una splendida cornice di alberi che rendono particolarmente piacevole la visita anche in primavera ed estate, in cui sono visitabili gli scavi della Villa Romana.\\u003cbr\\u003eLa villa identificata dalla tradizione come la villa del senatore Decio Albino Cecina, fu costruita nel I secolo a.C. e rimase in uso fino al V secolo d.C. \\u003cbr\\u003eNel percorso di visita all\'esterno i visitatori e le visitatrici avranno il piacere di scoprire i resti di questa grandiosa villa romana e poter entrare all\'interno della cisterna sotterranea, perfettamente conservata che approvvigionava d\'acqua tutto l\'impianto residenziale.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://museoparcoarcheologicocecina.visitcecina.com/guida-al-parco-archeologico/\\u0022\\u003eClicca e guarda in anteprima la guida digitale del Parco!\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\"},\"en\":{\"text\":\"The Municipal Archaeological Park stands on a small hill in a beautiful setting surrounded by trees, making it particularly pleasant to visit in spring and summer, when the excavations of the Roman Villa can be visited.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe villa, traditionally identified as the villa of Senator Decio Albino Cecina, was built in the 1st century BC and remained in use until the 5th century AD.\\u003cbr\\u003eDuring the outdoor tour, visitors will have the pleasure of discovering the remains of this magnificent Roman villa and entering the perfectly preserved underground cistern that supplied water to the entire residential complex.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://museoparcoarcheologicocecina.visitcecina.com/guida-al-parco-archeologico/\\u0022\\u003e\\u003ckbd\\u003eClick and preview the digital guide to the Park!\\u003c/kbd\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e\"},\"fr\":{\"text\":\"Le Parc Archéologique Municipal se trouve sur une petite colline dans un cadre magnifique entouré d\'arbres qui rendent la visite particulièrement agréable au printemps et en été, où l\'on peut visiter les fouilles de la villa romaine.\\u003cbr\\u003eLa villa, identifiée par la tradition comme celle du sénateur Decio Albino Cecina, a été construite au Ier siècle avant J.-C. et est restée en usage jusqu\'au Ve siècle après J.-C.\\u003cbr\\u003eAu cours de la visite extérieure, les visiteurs auront le plaisir de découvrir les vestiges de cette grandiose villa romaine et de pouvoir entrer dans la citerne souterraine, parfaitement conservée, qui alimentait en eau l\'ensemble du complexe résidentiel.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ckbd\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\u0022https://museoparcoarcheologicocecina.visitcecina.com/guida-al-parco-archeologico/\\u0022\\u003eCliquez ici pour consulter le guide digital du Parc!\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/kbd\\u003e\"}}},\"gallery\":[{\"id\":3632,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/IMG_5100-scaled.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3633,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/IMG_5107-scaled.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3638,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/mosaico.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3634,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/IMG_5069-Migliorato-NR-scaled.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3636,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/IMG_5054-Migliorato-NR-scaled.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3639,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/parco.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"id\":3637,\"url\":\"https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/IMG_5056-Migliorato-NR-scaled.jpg\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5},\"alt\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"}],\"video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_5TTm-ivjqE\",\"additional_info\":{\"date_text\":{\"translation\":{\"it\":{\"text\":\"Dal 1 Maggio al 30 Settembre:  - Mercoledì e Giovedì: 17:00-20:00;     - Venerdì, Sabato e Domenica: 10:00-13:00 / 17:00-20:00            Dal 1 Ottobre al 30 Aprile:  - Mercoledì e Giovedì: 14:00-17:00;     - Venerdì, Sabato e Domenica:  10:00-13:00 / 14:00-17:00                                                                                                                  𝐁𝐈𝐆𝐋𝐈𝐄𝐓𝐓𝐈 𝐌𝐔𝐒𝐄𝐎: • Intero 3,50€ • Ridotto (6-18 anni, over 65, Studente della Toscana) 2,50€ • Cumulativo (MUSEO+PARCO) 6,00€ • Famiglia (2 adulti + 2 minori paganti) 9,00€ • Cumulativo Famiglia 15,00€ • Gratuito (0-5 anni, persone con disabilità + accompagnatore, membri ICOM) 0,00€                   \"},\"en\":{\"text\":\"From 1 May to 30 September: - Wednesday and Thursday: 5:00 pm to 8:00 pm;      - Friday, Saturday and Sunday: 10:00 am to 1:00 pm / 5:00 pm to 8:00 pm            From 1 October to 30 April:  - Wednesday and Thursday: 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m.;      - Friday, Saturday and Sunday: 10:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m. / 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m.                                                                                                                                       MUSEUM TICKETS: • Full price €3.50 • Reduced price (6-18 years old, over 65, students from Tuscany) €2.50 • Combined ticket (MUSEUM+PARK) €6.00 • Family (2 adults + 2 paying children) €9.00 • Combined family ticket €15.00 • Free (0-5 years old, people with disabilities + accompanying person, ICOM members) €0.00\"},\"fr\":{\"text\":\"Du 1er Mai au 30 Septembre : - Mercredi et Jeudi: 17:00-20:00;     - Vendredi, Samedi et Dimanche: 10:00-13:00 / 17:00-20:00            Du 1er Octobre au 30 Avril :  - Mercredi et Jeudi: 14:00-17:00;     - Vendredi, Samedi et Dimanche: 10:00-13:00 / 14:00-17:00                                                                                 BILLETS MUSÉE : • Plein tarif 3,50€ • Tarif réduit (6-18 ans, plus de 65 ans, étudiants de Toscane) 2,50€ • Cumulatif (MUSÉE+PARC) 6,00€ • Famille (2 adultes + 2 enfants payants) 9,00€ • Cumulatif famille 15,00€ • Gratuit (0-5 ans, personnes handicapées + accompagnateur, membres ICOM) 0,00€\"}}},\"accessibility\":{\"label\":\"Media\",\"value\":\"2\"}},\"contacts\":{\"telephone\":\"0586 61 15 88\",\"email\":\"museoarcheologico@comune.cecina.li.it\",\"website\":\"https://www.comune.cecina.livorno.it/area_letturaLuogo/1151/pagsistema.html\",\"facebook\":\"https://www.facebook.com/MuseoeParcoArcheologicodiCecina\",\"instagram\":\"https://www.instagram.com/museo_parco_archeologicocecina/\"}}} /-->', 'Parco Archeologico Comunale', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'parco-archeologico-comunale', '', '', '2026-03-04 15:00:24', '2026-03-04 14:00:24', '', 0, 'https://gestionale.qualitymade.eu/?post_type=qzr_object&#038;p=3613', 0, 'qzr_object', '', 0),
